{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block body %}
    <section class="nowo-ui-card">
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__header"><h2 class="nowo-ui-card__title">Model Context Protocol endpoint</h2></div>
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__body">
        <p>This demo serves <code>POST /mcp</code> with <code>nowo-tech/mcp-kit-bundle</code>: stateless Streamable HTTP,
            JSON answers, revisions 2026-07-28 (modern) and 2025-11-25 / 2025-06-18 (legacy).</p>
    </div>
    </section>
    <section class="nowo-ui-card">
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__header"><h2 class="nowo-ui-card__title">Demo tokens (throwaway)</h2></div>
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__body">
        <ul>
            <li><code>demo-read-token-change-me</code>: ada, notes read: <code>note_list</code>, <code>note_get</code></li>
            <li><code>demo-edit-token-change-me</code>: ada, notes edit: adds <code>note_create</code></li>
            <li><code>demo-full-token-change-me</code>: grace, notes edit and the destructive tick: adds <code>note_archive</code></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    </section>
    <section class="nowo-ui-card">
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__header"><h2 class="nowo-ui-card__title">Connect Claude Code</h2></div>
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__body">
        <pre class="nowo-ui-code-block">claude mcp add --transport http mcp-kit-demo http://localhost:8219/mcp --header "Authorization: Bearer demo-read-token-change-me"</pre>
    </div>
    </section>
    <section class="nowo-ui-card">
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__header"><h2 class="nowo-ui-card__title">Call it with curl</h2></div>
        <div class="nowo-ui-card__body">
        <pre class="nowo-ui-code-block">curl -s http://localhost:8219/mcp \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer demo-read-token-change-me' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -H 'MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28' -H 'Mcp-Method: tools/call' -H 'Mcp-Name: note_get' \
  -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"note_get","arguments":{"id":"7c2e9a41-5b3d-4f6e-8a1c-2d4e6f8a0b12"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}'</pre>
        <p>That note holds injection text on purpose: it comes back under <code>untrusted</code>, behind the fixed notice,
            with hidden characters escaped in the text block.</p>
    </div>
    </section>
{% endblock %}
